 "text": "-->\nHome | Dearwest Grain Services\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nHome\nMarkets\nFutures\nCash Bids\nGrain\nGrain Merchants\nAverage Price Contracts\nAPC History\nBasis History\nGrain Calculators\nDiscount Schedule\nFeed\nCattle\nSwine\nSheep & Goat\nEquine\nPoultry\nPet Food\nRabbit\nDrones\nWeather\nPhotos\nFair, Farm & Events Photos\nDearwester Grain Services' Projects\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nLocations\nEmployment\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nContact Us!\nOUR SERVICES\nCONTACT US\nCheck Out Our Dearwester Photos!\nClick Here!\nLog In\nDisclaimer: Cash bids are subject to change without notice.\nCash Bid Quotes are for reference only when the market closes at 1:15 until basis is updated at 4:15 for a closing cash price.\nA Bit About Us:\nEstablished in 1996\nMatt and Andrea Dearwester are Adams County, Illinois natives who \"took a leap of faith\" and built this business in their own “backyard”. What began as a single facility in 1996, with only two employees, has expanded to eleven locations and 65 employees. Dearwester Grain Services, Inc. continues as a family-owned business and has grown into the area’s most dependable, honest, and trustworthy grain and feed dealer of West Central Illinois. Dearwester Grain thrives because of the passion to provide what the marketplace needs with the desire and drive to grow exponentially to better serve.\nOur Goal For You\n\"At Dearwester Grain Services, Inc and Nutrition Services, Inc., we provide a distinguishable balance between high quality feed production and successful grain marketing strategies for producers in the local marketplace,\" says Matt Dearwester. \"We accomplish this mission with knowledgeable and skilled employees, who provide reliable, dependable and equitable service at every level of our business.\"\nOUR LOCATIONS\nDearwester Grain Locations\nCheck Us Out On Social!\nCREDIT APPLICATION\nLINDNER FEEDS CREDIT APP.\nACH AUTHORIZATION FORM\nLINDNER FEED AUTHORIZATION FORM\n​Bentley: (217)357-3423\nIndustry: (309)333-7561\nCarthage East: (217)908-1100\nLa Prairie-Chatton: (217)696-4491\nCarthage West: (217)357-2192\nLiberty: (217)645-3441\n​Clayton: (217)894-6561\nMt. Sterling: (217)773-9030\nGolden: (217)696-4461\nPaloma: (217)455-2600\nWe're Here for You.\nbottom of page",
